 about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tiles are defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"conforms to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A raster DEM source is added to an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHillshadeStyleLayer"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNColorReliefStyleLayer"},{"text":" objects. Use a hillshade","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"style layer to control the appearance of content supplied by the raster DEM source,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a color relief style layer to render elevation data with a color ramp.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNRasterDEMSource","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterDEMSource","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrasterdemsource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterDEMSource","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/docum